          "version": 3,
          "body": "<style>\n* {box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0;padding: 0}\nhtml {font-size: 16px;background-color: #f8fafc;color: #1e293b;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased}\nbody {min-height: 100vh;display: flex;flex-direction: column}\n\n/* Nav: 顶部细横条 */\n.top-nav {position: sticky;top: 0;z-index: 50;background-color: #0f172a;color: #94a3b8;height: 40px;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;padding: 0 2rem;font-size: 0.8125rem;letter-spacing: 0.04em}\n.nav-brand {color: #f1f5f9;font-weight: 600;text-decoration: none}\n.nav-links {display: flex;gap: 1.75rem;list-style: none}\n.nav-links a {color: #94a3b8;text-decoration: none;transition: color 0.15s ease}\n.nav-links a:hover {color: #06b6d4}\n.nav-status {display: inline-flex;align-items: center;gap: 0.5rem;color: #38bdf8;font-family: monospace}\n.nav-status-indicator {width: 6px;height: 6px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #06b6d4}\n\n/* Main Container */\nmain {flex: 1;max-width: 1200px;width: 100%;margin: 0 auto;padding: 2.5rem 2rem 5rem}\n\n/* Hero: 杂志式多栏网格配引言 */\n.hero-magazine {margin-bottom: 4.5rem;padding-bottom: 2.5rem;border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0}\n.magazine-meta-bar {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: baseline;padding-bottom: 1rem;margin-bottom: 2rem;border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size: 0.75rem;color: #64748b;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 0.08em}\n.magazine-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap: 2.5rem;align-items: start}\n.magazine-col-lead {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.5rem}\n.magazine-tag {color: #0891b2;font-size: 0.8125rem;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: 0.06em;text-transform: uppercase}\nh1.brand-title {font-size: 3.25rem;line-height: 1.08;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.03em}\n.lead-summary {font-size: 1.0625rem;color: #475569;line-height: 1.7}\n\n/* 引言 blockquote */\n.epigraph-box {margin-top: 0.5rem;padding: 1.5rem;background-color: #f1f5f9}\n.epigraph-quote {font-size: 0.9375rem;font-style: italic;color: #334155;line-height: 1.75}\n.epigraph-cite {display: block;margin-top: 0.75rem;font-size: 0.75rem;font-style: normal;color: #0891b2;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: 0.05em}\n\n.magazine-col-mid {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.5rem;padding: 0 0.5rem}\n.col-header-label {font-size: 0.8125rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-transform: uppercase;padding-bottom: 0.5rem;border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0}\n.magazine-col-mid p {font-size: 0.9375rem;color: #475569;line-height: 1.7}\n.spec-mini-table {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.75rem;margin-top: 0.5rem}\n.spec-row {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;font-size: 0.875rem;padding-bottom: 0.5rem;border-bottom: 1px dashed #e2e8f0}\n.spec-row-k {color: #64748b}\n.spec-row-v {color: #0f172a;font-family: monospace;font-weight: 500}\n\n.magazine-col-side {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.25rem;background-color: #e2e8f0;padding: 1.5rem}\n.magazine-col-side h3 {font-size: 0.9375rem;color: #0f172a;font-weight: 600}\n.magazine-col-side ul {list-style: none;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.875rem}\n.magazine-col-side li {font-size: 0.8125rem;color: #334155;line-height: 1.5;position: relative;padding-left: 1rem}\n.magazine-col-side li::before {content: \"—\";position: absolute;left: 0;color: #0891b2}\n\n/* Section Headings */\n.section-meta-header {margin-bottom: 2rem;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.5rem}\n.section-index {font-size: 0.75rem;font-family: monospace;color: #0891b2;letter-spacing: 0.1em;text-transform: uppercase}\n.section-title {font-size: 1.75rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a;letter-spacing: -0.02em}\n.section-desc {font-size: 0.9375rem;color: #64748b;max-width: 680px}\n\n/* Card: 1 无边框仅靠留白分隔 */\n/* Plans View: 2 纵向列表逐行展开 */\n.plans-section {margin-bottom: 5rem}\n.plans-list-container {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.5rem}\n.plan-row-card {/* 无边框，靠背景留白与深浅间距分隔 */\n  background-color: #ffffff;padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 200px 180px 1fr 140px;align-items: center;gap: 2rem}\n.plan-row-card.highlight {background-color: #f1f5f9}\n.plan-identity {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.35rem}\n.plan-tag {display: inline-block;align-self: flex-start;font-size: 0.6875rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0e7490;background-color: #cffafe;padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;letter-spacing: 0.05em;text-transform: uppercase}\n.plan-name {font-size: 1.375rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a}\n.plan-type {font-size: 0.8125rem;color: #64748b}\n.plan-pricing {display: flex;flex-direction: column}\n.plan-price-monthly {font-size: 1.625rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a;font-family: monospace}\n.plan-price-annually {font-size: 0.8125rem;color: #0891b2;margin-top: 0.25rem}\n.plan-capabilities {list-style: none;display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);gap: 0.625rem 1.25rem}\n.plan-capabilities li {font-size: 0.875rem;color: #334155;display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 0.5rem}\n.plan-capabilities li::before {content: \"•\";color: #0891b2;font-weight: bold}\n.plan-action {display: flex;justify-content: flex-end}\n.plan-action-link {display: inline-flex;align-items: center;justify-content: center;background-color: #0f172a;color: #f8fafc;text-decoration: none;font-size: 0.875rem;font-weight: 600;padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;transition: background-color 0.15s ease;width: 100%;text-align: center}\n.plan-action-link:hover {background-color: #0891b2}\n.plan-row-card.highlight .plan-action-link {background-color: #0891b2;color: #ffffff}\n.plan-row-card.highlight .plan-action-link:hover {background-color: #0e7490}\n\n/* Protocols & Setup Section */\n.setup-section {margin-bottom: 5rem}\n.setup-layout {display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;gap: 2rem}\n.setup-card {/* 无边框卡片，靠背景色与大留白 */\n  background-color: #ffffff;padding: 2.5rem;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.25rem}\n.setup-card h3 {font-size: 1.125rem;color: #0f172a;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: -0.01em}\n.setup-card p {font-size: 0.9375rem;color: #475569;line-height: 1.7}\n.setup-steps {list-style: none;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1rem;margin-top: 0.5rem}\n.setup-steps li {font-size: 0.875rem;color: #334155;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr;gap: 0.75rem;line-height: 1.6}\n.step-num {font-family: monospace;font-size: 0.8125rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0891b2}\n\n/* FAQ: 2 编号列表 */\n.faq-section {margin-bottom: 3rem}\n.faq-numbered-list {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.5rem}\n.faq-item {/* 无边框，通过白底与留白建立空间独立性 */\n  background-color: #ffffff;padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;gap: 2rem;align-items: baseline}\n.faq-number {font-family: monospace;font-size: 1.5rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0891b2;letter-spacing: 0.05em}\n.faq-content {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.75rem}\n.faq-question {font-size: 1.125rem;font-weight: 700;color: #0f172a;line-height: 1.4}\n.faq-answer {font-size: 0.9375rem;color: #475569;line-height: 1.75}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {background-color: #0f172a;color: #64748b;padding: 3rem 2rem;font-size: 0.8125rem;margin-top: auto}\n.footer-inner {max-width: 1200px;margin: 0 auto;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;flex-wrap: wrap;gap: 1.5rem}\n.footer-brand {color: #94a3b8;font-weight: 600}\n.footer-note {max-width: 600px;line-height: 1.6}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 992px) {.magazine-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 2rem;}\n  .plan-row-card {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 1.25rem;}\n  .plan-capabilities {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;}\n  .plan-action {\n    justify-content: stretch;}\n  .setup-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;}\n  .faq-item {\n    grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr;gap: 1.25rem;padding: 1.75rem;}}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .top-nav {padding: 0 1rem}\n  .nav-links {gap: 1rem}\n  main {padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem}\n  h1.brand-title {font-size: 2.25rem}\n  .plan-row-card {padding: 1.5rem}\n  .setup-card {padding: 1.5rem}\n  .faq-item {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 0.5rem;padding: 1.5rem}\n  .faq-number {font-size: 1.125rem}\n}\n</style><nav class=\"top-nav\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-brand\">花云 ARCHIVE</a>\n  <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n    <li><a href=\"#overview\">概览</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#plans\">订阅规范</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#setup\">分流适配</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#faq\">运行答疑</a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"nav-status\">\n    <span class=\"nav-status-indicator\"></span>\n    <span>DISPATCH ONLINE</span>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<main>\n  \n  <section id=\"overview\" class=\"hero-magazine\">\n    <div class=\"magazine-meta-bar\">\n      <span>Document No. HY-2025-SPEC</span>\n      <span>Topic: Distributed Network Routing &amp; Channel Profiles</span>\n      <span>Published for General Inquiry</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"magazine-grid\">\n      \n      <div class=\"magazine-col-lead\">\n        <span class=\"magazine-tag\">网络架构与规约文档</span>\n        <h1 class=\"brand-title\">花云</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead-summary\">\n          花云通过标准网络协议集与结构化节点编排，为多终端提供可靠的数据路由中继标准。系统遵循严格的配置语法与透明的容量约束，满足常规浏览与分布式协作中的规则分流需求。\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"epigraph-box\">\n          <blockquote class=\"epigraph-quote\">\n            “网络分流与数据通道的本质在于可控性与规则明确，而非不可验证的技术神话；规范的数据配额与明确的终端并发才是系统长期稳定的基础。”\n          </blockquote>\n          — 花云网络运行准则 卷首语\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"magazine-col-mid\">\n        <div class=\"col-header-label\">系统核心指标概述</div>\n        <p>\n          本系统将可用出口按网络区域划分为独立通道单元。客户端依据本地配置规则进行按需分流，流量统计遵循周期性重置逻辑，所有数据流向依据公开协议报文标准进行解析。\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"spec-mini-table\">\n          <div class=\"spec-row\">\n            <span class=\"spec-row-k\">配置文件格式</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-row-v\">YAML / Base64 Profile</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-row\">\n            <span class=\"spec-row-k\">并发控制机制</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-row-v\">IP / Session Limiter</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-row\">\n            <span class=\"spec-row-k\">流媒体规则解析</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-row-v\">GeoIP &amp; Domain Match</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spec-row\">\n            <span class=\"spec-row-k\">工单响应周期</span>\n            <span class=\"spec-row-v\">Tier-based SLA</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"magazine-col-side\">\n        <h3>配置约束与规范</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>订阅链接属于私有凭证，不可向非信任网络广播或公开共享。</li>\n          <li>各套餐均有确定的同时在线设备上限，超额接入将触发会话重置。</li>\n          <li>节点健康状态由系统心跳探测程序周期同步，状态异常将自动剔除路由表。</li>\n          <li>客户端分流规则建议优先采用域名匹配（DOMAIN-SUFFIX）以降低 DNS 污染影响。</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"plans\" class=\"plans-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-meta-header\">\n      <span class=\"section-index\">SECTION 01 / QUOTA &amp; TIERS</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">订阅套餐与容量分配</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">花云依据流量周期额度与终端连接规模提供阶梯式订阅档位。所有计划均列明固定参数，按需选用。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-list-container\">\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-row-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-identity\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\">基础版</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-type\">个人轻量网络中继</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥15 / 月</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price-annually\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-capabilities\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action-link\">查看明细</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-row-card highlight\">\n        <div class=\"plan-identity\">\n          <span class=\"plan-tag\">推荐配置</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-type\">高频访问与低时延专线</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥35 / 月</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price-annually\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-capabilities\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action-link\">选择订阅</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"plan-row-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-identity\">\n          <span class=\"plan-name\">团队版</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-type\">多成员协同与企业分流</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <span class=\"plan-price-monthly\">¥85 / 月</span>\n          <span class=\"plan-price-annually\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-capabilities\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-action\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action-link\">联系对接</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"setup\" class=\"setup-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-meta-header\">\n      <span class=\"section-index\">SECTION 02 / PROTOCOLS &amp; RUNTIME</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">客户端适配与导入规程</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">花云不绑定特定私有软件，遵循主流内核与通行配置文件标准。请根据所用操作系统选择对应的分流软件。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"setup-layout\">\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <h3>跨平台协议兼容说明</h3>\n        <p>\n          系统后端支持通用代理协议子集。用户可通过标准统一资源标识符（URI）或订阅解析器拉取远程规则集。适用于 Windows、macOS、Linux、iOS 与 Android 平台中支持对应协议规范的第三方开源核心。\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          所有配置均以纯文本或标准编码提供，支持自定义添加白名单、黑名单以及针对内部局域网的私有绕过规则（LAN Bypass）。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <h3>四步接入引导</h3>\n        <ul class=\"setup-steps\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"step-num\">01</span>\n            <div>在控制中心生成专属于您账户的节点订阅配置文件地址。</div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"step-num\">02</span>\n            <div>将该地址填入兼容客户端的订阅管理或规则集下载项中。</div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"step-num\">03</span>\n            <div>触发远程规则拉取，核对节点列表、延迟探测值与策略组划分。</div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"step-num\">04</span>\n            <div>设置本地路由模式为“规则分流（Rule-based）”，完成系统级集成。</div>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-meta-header\">\n      <span class=\"section-index\">SECTION 03 / OPERATIONAL INQUIRIES</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题与运维答疑</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">关于账户计费周期、终端数管理及网络策略的冷静说明与排错建议。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-numbered-list\">\n      <article class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-number\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question\">花云的每月流量何时重置？是否支持结转至下周期？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer\">\n            系统按自然月或订阅账单日作为计量周期。重置时间通常以您的账单激活时间点为准。未消耗完毕的流量属于当期定额，在计费周期到期时归零，不支持递延或结转至下个服务月份。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-number\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question\">“支持 X 台设备同时在线”的具体判定机制是什么？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer\">\n            系统网关根据向节点发起活跃 TCP/UDP 会话的独立客户端 IP 地址与凭证特征进行计数。同一局域网经由软路由等网关统一分流时计为单个接入端点；多台设备分别直接使用订阅连接时，各自占用一个并发额度。超出上限会导致新连接被暂时阻断。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-number\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question\">为何节点在客户端测试中显示超时或无响应？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer\">\n            超时通常由本地 ISP 的 DNS 污染、订阅配置未更新或目标端口被本地安全软件拦截引发。建议首先尝试更新订阅配置以刷新解析地址，排查本地系统代理权限设置，并确认本地系统时间与网络授时（NTP）误差在 60 秒以内。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-number\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question\">旗舰版与基础版在网络架构上有何实质区别？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer\">\n            基础版使用标准公共骨干出口的中继池，适合文字查阅与低并发请求；旗舰版引入专用专线通道资源（如 IPLC 线路优化），具有固定的内网传输时延和更高的抖动容忍度，同时在原生流媒体解析策略上提供全节点覆盖。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-number\">05</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question\">是否提供专属客户端应用程序下载？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer\">\n            花云当前致力于维护高质量的网络传输节点与配置文件格式标准，并未打包闭源专有安装包。用户可自由选用任何主流开源或商业规则分流软件，直接通过订阅链接拉取配置即可使用，避免专有客户端可能带来的系统冗余。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"footer-brand\">花云 ARCHIVE</span>\n      <p>技术规范标准与路由方案参考手册</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-note\">\n      花云仅向已授权订户提供标准数据中继和配置解析说明。请合理规划网络流量，严格遵循各接入端所在地域之技术标准与法律合规准则。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
